// Grounded Brain: learning artifact generation
// Eraser "Sequence Diagram" diagram-as-code
title Learning artifact generation
autoNumber on

Client [icon: monitor, color: gray] > ArtifactService [icon: nodejs, color: green]: POST /artifacts {type, title?, sourceIds?}
ArtifactService > Postgres [icon: postgres, color: blue]: verify ownership, resolve READY source ids (WIKI: GITHUB sources only; no content loaded)
ArtifactService > Postgres: INSERT artifact (PENDING)
ArtifactService > Inngest [icon: zap, color: purple]: send artifact/generate
ArtifactService --> Client: 201 artifact (PENDING)

Inngest > GenerateArtifactJob [icon: book-open, color: purple]: run (2 retries, cancelled by workspace/deleted)
activate GenerateArtifactJob
GenerateArtifactJob > Postgres: status PROCESSING, load READY sources with content (GITHUB: file tree prepended)
opt [label: combined text > 120k chars] {
  GenerateArtifactJob > OpenAI [icon: openai, color: orange]: condense oversized sources (60k-char segments, 4 in parallel)
}
GenerateArtifactJob > OpenAI: generateText (structured output validated by Zod)
GenerateArtifactJob > GenerateArtifactJob: sanitize (quiz answer indexes, mind map edges, wiki diagram fences)
GenerateArtifactJob > Postgres: READY + content (or FAILED + processingError)
deactivate GenerateArtifactJob

Client > ArtifactService: GET /artifacts/:id (poll)
ArtifactService --> Client: READY + content
